      "content": "those are some really strong, visceral archetypes. they definitely provide that sense of grit and immediate tension i'm looking for.\n\nto make the storytelling even more effective, i want to look at how these different social layers interact. specifically, i'm interested in the \"top-down\" pressure. \n\nif my street-level characters are living in these high-tension, neglected areas, i need the people at the very top of the city's hierarchy to feel like the absolute antithesis of that. could you help me flesh out a few characters who represent the elite, \"untouchable\" class—the ones who control the city's wealth, politics, or even its legal landscape? \n\ni'd love to see some character sketches for these high-power players, including their ethnic or cultural backgrounds, so i can create that massive, systemic divide between the people running the city and the people just trying to survive it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
